<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">2 Piyeer</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Pi</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Piyeer</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Piyeer kanakɗoh kaɓɗoh</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Piyeer kanakɗoh kaɓɗoh</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Piyeer ɓaahee ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ciŋ Yeesu. Saaŋ na Saak na Piyeer ɓeɗ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci kaahay ci tiik ciŋ ɓa uup woyu ŋ teereeci nikiis ci na naandsuke kipes kiŋ Yeesu. Marka Piyeer ŋ Limiŋ tiik ci. Ŋ teerndiŋ "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci", tiikiŋ Piyeer namiɗ pul nga waas laayiɗ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1-5">Tum ci 1–5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8-12">8–12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15">15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="ip">Wa Piyeer na fiise kaɓɗohii, a inheen ne kakaan kiŋ ɗe usisɗi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:14">2 Piyeer 1:14</ref></char></note> Wa miniɗ nik ne wa raak ɗe ŋ <char style="w">Rom</char>, laam findi Janguuna ɗeɓgaan naandsukoha, a apohu ndaam. A fiis kaɓɗohii wuu kosiɗ ci jen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:1">2 Piyeer 1:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="ip">A fiis kaɓɗohii ne a ñaah kosiɗ ci te a nak ɓa ne ɓa wortuk jangɗohoh ci baahaaɗiici. A namiɗ woo ŋ dokkiŋ Yeesu na reehiŋ Adina.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Piyeer kanakɗoh kaɓɗoh kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Kañɗohi <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Piyeer ñaahiɗ kosiɗ ci ne kosiŋ ɓa kaɗ fiki<char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 1:3-11">1:3-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Keeh kiŋ yegɗohi kaɗ ŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 1:12-21">1:12-21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Jangɗohoh ci leyoh ci <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 2">2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ini kaɗ ŋ dokkiŋ Kiristaani na reehiŋ Adina <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 3:1-16">3:1-16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Askohi <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 3:17-18">3:17-18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Mi yii kañiɗ ɗu, mi yi Simong Piyeer, <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, yi ɓaah ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ciŋ ɗe, mi yii fiis ɗu kaytii, ɗu ɓi rahas kosi car waaɗu findi wiŋ ɓoo. Ɗu rahasa taamboh ŋ yurhi Kiristaani yurah, a yi Koohiŋ ɓoo na Mucɗohiŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="2PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Baahohsaat, ɗu onu jam te in ceem gen ɓaatke, ŋ inhi ɗu inah Kooh na Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu !<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">In ci ɓoo etoh ne ɓoo raak kipes ŋoɗiɗ ŋ Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Ŋ hatiliŋ ɗe, Heɗi eɗiɗ ɓoo in ci ɓoo etoh jen ne ɓoo raak kipes ŋoɗiɗ nga ɗe. A eɗiɗ ɓoo ca taamboh ŋ inhi ɓoo inah Kooh yi ɓeeɗuk ɓoo. A ɓeeɗuk ɓoo taamboh ŋ yaki a yak ŋ haf ce na baah kiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Ŋ ineem, a gapeen ɓoo gapoh baahiɗ ci ɓo' inahɗi findi ca hend te ɓoo rahsiɗ ca. A tumiɗ ineem ne ɗu fus ŋ maɗaah ci baahaaɗiici na yahrohe ɓi adinaanii, ɗu raak ɓak ŋ kipes kiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Ineem, weɗ tah, ndengɗukaat keeh-keeh,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2PE 1:5">te ŋ kosiŋ ɗu, ɗu ɓaat nga tumohaaɗ baahiɗ,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2PE 1:5">ŋ tumohaaɗi baahɗeem, ɗu ɓaat nga inah Kooh,<verse eid="2PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />ŋ inhiŋ Kooh weem, ɗu ɓaat nga min amb haf ɗu,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2PE 1:6">ŋ min kiŋ ɗu amb haf ɗu weem, ɗu ɓaat nga muñ miskiɗ,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2PE 1:6">ŋ muñiŋ miskiɗeem, ɗu ɓaat nga ŋoɗ ŋ Kooh,<verse eid="2PE 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />ŋ ŋoɗiŋ ɗu ŋ Kooh weem, ɗu ɓaat nga waaɗtiɗoh ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2PE 1:7">te ŋ waaɗtiɗohiŋ ɗu weem, ɗu ɓaat nga waaɗ ɓooɓi keeh-keeh.<verse eid="2PE 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Laam in ceem jen nik nga ɗu te ca gen ɓaatuk ɗah, inhi ɗu inah Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa hey tume po ɗu nikanɗi yoondɗukaaɗi wala raakaaɗi njiriñ. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Waaye ɓo' nu in ceem nikɗi nga ɗe ɗah, a mand na fuuliɗ, has ciŋ ɗe na hoteeɗi usiɗ. A alkohiɗ ne a hoolɗuuɗ ŋ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗe ɗeɓgaan.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Ineem weɗ tah, ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ndengɗukaat po ɓeeɗki Kooh ɓeeɗuk ɗu na kooɗi a kooɗ ɗu nik in wooriɗ nga ɗu ; ɗu tuma ɗah, ɗu keenanɗi muk. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Te ŋ ineem, ɗu hey rangsiɗasse baahiɗ buntaaciŋ Nguuri genan po faw, Nguuriŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa, Mucɗohiŋ ɓoo.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Woo ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci na woosuuɗ ci oolkaah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Ineem weɗ tah, ŋ genan ɗu naandis in ceem, ali nik ne ɗu inhiɗ ca po ƴutiɗ sah te ɗu tufkiɗ po ɗu ndengiɗ ngaŋ keeh ki ɗu teeɓu. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Ŋ amb ne wa ini ŋ joy tum feeh mi yii pes ɗah ne ŋ yunee ɗu ŋ naandsoh ceem. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Laam, ŋ inhiɗ ne ŋ hey saɓsukohe na faanii maañaaɗi, findi Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa ŋ haf ce teeɓoh ho wa. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Waaye, ŋ hey ndengɗuke po, ŋ finho cootiŋ ngo, ɗu genee naandsuk in ceem.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Wi ɓoo yegɗee ɗu hayiŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa ŋ hatiliŋ ɗe, ɓoo gaƴkeeɗi ŋ andiini feru ŋ hereñ ɓo', ɓoo hotoot hotoot yaki a yak. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Laam Kooh Baabi a yi eɗ ɗe cir, yakiɗta ɗe, wa nikee wa hoosooraŋ Kooh yi Heɗ kiyak hay nga ɗe, woosa ne : « Yii a yi <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ngo</char> ŋ waaɗ keeh-keeh, yi neɓ po ŋ keeñ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:5">Macce 17:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Maarko 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk 9:35</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Ɓoo kerhootiɗ hoosooreem puloh Asamaan, wa ɓoo nik na Yeesu ŋ tangooraŋ Kooh.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Wa ɓaatta ɓoo woor ne woo ciŋ woosuuɗ ci tufkiɗ, te wa baahiɗ ne ɗu faɗoh ca nof. Ca mand na laampaani na siñaarɗe ŋ ɗisik ñuusiɗ, po ŋ wiisaaɗi, jaar mbeedi pul, hori na ɓaaɓ. Wa siñaariɗ ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɗu.<verse eid="2PE 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Bala ali in, inhaat ne, ŋ woo-woosuuɗ ci nik ŋ Fiis ci, ali woosuuɗ moosɗi woyoh woo ciŋ ɗe haf ce<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"ŋ woo-woosuuɗ ci nik ŋ Fiis ci, ali woosuuɗ moosɗi woyoh woo ciŋ ɗe haf ce" : ini gerek woo ndii, wa namiɗ min tokis : "ali ɓo' minɗi tokis woo-woosuuɗ ci nik ŋ Fiis ci ŋ findi a na liiɓohe ŋ haf ce."</char></note>. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Laam ali woosuuɗ moosɗi woyoh ŋ ini a waaɗ ŋ haf ce. A <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> hiiree ɓa, ɓa yegɗoheeɗa woo kiŋ Kooh.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Jangɗohoh ci leyoh ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Ɗeɓgaan, ɓi woosuuɗ leyoh nikeen ŋ ɗooƴ cuuɓiŋ Israayel ; wa nam mand ɗaa, ɓi jangɗohoh leyoh hey name nik ŋ harmban ɗu. Jangɗohoh ceem hey ɓeke, ŋ ɗooƴ jangɗoh ciŋ ɓa, liiɓohaaɗ ci na ɓaye ɓo' ŋ muuƴ ; ɓa hey kee po ɓa taas Heɗi tos ɓa. Ŋ ineem, ɓa ɓek haf ɓa ŋ muuƴi gaawan ɓa sooƴiɗ. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Laayiɗ hey ɓa taambɗe ŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa sepƴiɗ ci. Ɓa hey tahe po waasiŋ keeh ki ɓasu. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Waaɗi ɓa waaɗ kopor hey tahe po ɓa feree lee, ɓa ñaañohee ɗu na ca. Atte'uukiŋ ɓa cambiɗ maañ, te sooƴɗuukiŋ ɓa tufkiɗ.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Laam Kooh faɗɗi sah malaakaaci bakaaɗe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">malaakaaci bakaaɗe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ɓum liiɓ ne e safaal ciŋ teerndiŋ </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-4">Camba 6:1-4</ref></char>, ɓum liiɓ ne e malaakaaci hunee na Seytaani (marka ini fiisu ŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 25:41">Macce 25:41</ref></char>).</note>, a njaf ca ŋ nunga topaaɗiina, a tokka ca na ceen ŋ ñuus tuɗ po ŋ mbaɗnaŋ atteena. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />A faɗɗi sah adinaana ɗeɓgaan, waaye ŋ jamanoona a ruhsiɗoh masma laayɗa ŋ adinaani riifee na sangiɗ ciŋ ɗe, a mucɗiɗ Noohin na ɓo' yasna-kanak wiiriis, Noohin yi woyee ɓooɓa ne ɓa yurhaat.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6-9">Camba 6–9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Kooh atte'iɗ kur-taah ci kanak ci Sodom na Gomor, a hoomiɗta ca, po ca nikka misaal ŋ sangiɗ ciŋ ɗe na haye. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Waaye a mucɗiɗ Loot yurhiɗi, yi raakee ini misik ɗe lool ŋ cakaaya ɓooɓa yurhaaɗiicaam nikohe. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Loot genee ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa, a yi a nikee ɓo' yurhiɗ. A meeɗta raak miskiɗ noh na wek sagu tumohaaɗ caŋ ɓa moɗaaɗiica a hotee, a kerheeɗa ca.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:16-19:29">Camba 18:16–19:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="2PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Mbaa Heɗi inhiɗ findi a mucɗohan ɓi ŋoɗ nga ɗe po ɓa pul ŋ miskiɗ ci, te a ambiɗ yurhaaɗiici, ɓa na sekɗohse mbehaŋ atteena ne ɓa mbugalu. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />A uupan mbugal ɓi na taambɗe kiñin ciŋ ɓa ŋ waaɗ-waaɗ usɓiɗ, ɓa heeffa kikilifaakiŋ ɗe. Jangɗohoh ci leyoh ceem, ɓa ɓo' yegiɗ haf ɓa, te ɓa yaksiɗukka, ɓa nupɗi sah ɓas yakɗuuɗ ci. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Te ŋ hot malaakaaci sah na yambeeɗi yakɗuuɗ ceem na woo ɓaseeh ŋ fiki Heɗi, te moona malaakaaci ceɗ uupiɗ yakɗuuɗ ceem doole na hatil.<verse eid="2PE 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Waaye ɓeɗ, ɓa mand na ɗoopaat ci raakɗi hel, ci na taambɗe yeg-yeg ciŋ ca, ca rimu ne ca ambu, ca apu ; ɓa na ɓase in ci ɓa inahɗi. Ɓa hey name sooƴ, <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />wa nik wirndiŋ yurhaaɗiikiŋ ɓa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:13">Mbalay na noh cong, weɗ ini neɓ ɓa. Ɓa cohha na ɗu ne ɗu ɓaah kañam ɗah, ɓa na kaci'ɗohe kaci'ɗoh, ɓa sepeƴnukaah, ɓa na raake neɓiɗ ngaŋ lee ciŋ ɓa. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Has ciŋ ɓa na gene waak ɓitɓi ɓa njaaloo'an na ɗe, te ɓa minɗi doyiɗ bakaaɗ, ɓa na ñaañohe ɓooɓi kos ciŋ ɓa ndengɗi. Ɓa mokɗiɗ waaɗ kopor ; ɓa alku'iɗ. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Ɓa faɗiɗ waasi yurhiɗi, ɓa muuƴiɗ, ŋ taambɗi ɓa taambiɗ waasiŋ Balaam, kuɓkiŋ Bosor<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bosor </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ teerndiŋ Kind ci, a teeku Beyor (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 22:5">Kind ci 22:5</ref></char>).</note>, yi waaɗee eɗu kopor po a tummba yurhaaɗi. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Waaye a ngasuusa ŋ ɗali a ɗal waasi : A mbaam, yi minɗi woo, a yi woo findi ɓo', a faɗɗukohha woosuuɗeem naandohaaɗi a waaɗee tum.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:5-24:25">Kind ci 22:5–24:25</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 31:16">31:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Jangɗohoh ci leyoh ceem, ɓa cul raakaaɗi masuɓ, suti puuɗsi na coottohe, Kooh kooɗkiɗiɗ ɓa ɗisik ñuusiɗ tuɗ. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Ɓa na ñaañohe ɓi ɓa na muuƴɗe na woo ciŋ ɓa yaksiɗkohaaci, woo ci ɓo' minɗi kooɗoh in. Na woo ceem, ɓa nookee ɓi han puloh ŋ mboolndiŋ muuƴiɗ ci, ɓa ɓekee ɓa ŋ cakaay. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Ɓa gapee ɓa raak haf ɓa, te ɓeɗ ŋ haf ɓa ɓa <char style="w">ñaam</char> ciŋ waaɗ-waaɗ ci na yahrohee ɓa, laam in nu min ɗa ɗah, fu ñaamiŋ wa.<verse eid="2PE 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Nik ne ɓa inheen Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, Heɗi na Mucɗohi, po ɓa pulla ŋ hoolaaɗiiciŋ Adina, po ƴutta, ɓa longissa ŋ hoolaaɗiiceem, ca minnda ɓa ɗah, mirndohaaɗiŋ ɓa uupan moɗaaɗi cambohaana. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Ɓa inah waasi yurhiɗi po ƴut, ɓa suungɗuk nakoh ci hooliɗ ci ɓa rahas ɗah, e inhaaɗi wa ngisohee nga ɓa. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Woyohaaɗii keeh nga ɓa : Ɓuu fi dokkissiɗ ŋ in ca a huke.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 26:11">Gonaah ci 26:11</ref></char></note> Na wii : Mbaam-huk, ali fu ɓook ɗe ɓook, a walañkis ŋ ndapalaaƴ mi.<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Maañ maañ Heɗi hey hee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, wii weɗ fiisi kanakɗoh, wi maa kaɓɗohee ɗu. Ca kanak jen mi na naandsee ɗu in ci ɗu jangɗasse, ne ŋ yun kiñaañ kiŋ ɗu po ɗu liiɓee hooliɗ. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Ŋ waaɗ ne ɗu naandsuk woo ci woosuuɗ ciŋ Kooh woyee ɗeɓgaan, na nakoh ciŋ Heɗi Mucɗohi, ci <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ciŋ ɗu woyee ɗu.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Bala ali in, inhaat ne ŋ jamanooci mirndoh, wa hey raake ɓi njembtohoh, ɓa na hee taambɗe kiñin ciŋ ɓa. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Te ɓa hey woye ne : « A gapohee ne a hey haye haa e ? Wa nikan kiɗa ? Laam ina baab ci kaanoh poyi, in ci jen ris findi ca mandee ŋ cambaŋ feraŋ Adina. »<verse eid="2PE 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Ɓooɓeem na alkoh alkohɗuke ne ɗeɓgaan, Kooh fereen Eel na keheƴ taamboh ŋ woo kiŋ ɗe, kehƴeem pulohee ŋ masuɓ, wa nikee ŋ leero masuɓ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:6-9">Camba 1:6-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Te masmeem weɗ riifɗee adinaana ɗeɓgaan, wa ɗummbaa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6-8">Camba 6–8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Te woo keem, weɗ ɗaak Eel ci na kehƴi woti ndii, ca na sekɗohse yongkaahaŋ mbehaŋ atteena, wi sangiɗ ciŋ Kooh ɗumbohsan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:15-16">Esayi 66:15-16</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 1:18">Sofooni 1:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, raakiɗ ini ɗu joyɗi alkoh, weɗ ne mbeh yino ŋ Heɗi mand na kiis junni (1000) te kiis junni (1000) mand na mbeh yino nga ɗe. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Heɗi raɓuuɗi ŋ ini a gapohee tum, findi ɓum liiɓoha. A na muñɗee ɗu, a waaɗɗi ne ali ɓo' nga ɗu sooƴ, waaye a waaɗ ne ɓooɓi jen ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Waaye mbehiŋ Heɗi hayan findi rokoh. Ŋ mbeheem, eel ci hey coote na ɗuuɗ tiitɗohiɗ, in ci nik nga doh po ca yahrukoh, kehƴi na in ci haɓɗu nga jen hey atte'se<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Raakiɗ fiis ŋ fiis ci ɗeɓgaan, ci woo ne : "kehƴi na in ci nik nga jen hey sooƴe" ; cinooci nammba woo inii : "kehƴi na in ci nik nga jen hey naaye".</char></note>. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Nik ne in ci jen yahrukohan ɗaa ɗah, ɗu joyiɗ pes pes hooliɗ wuu Kooh, te ɗu ŋoɗ nga ɗe. <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />Ɗu sekee te ɗu seesuk mbehiŋ Kooh, wi eel ci jaalohan, ca yahrukoh, te in ci nik nga doh po ca naay. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Ɓoo nak, ɓoo ɓii sek eel as na keheƴ as, ɗiski yurah gen, findi Kooh gapoha.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Ineem weɗ tah, ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, ŋ seki ɗu na seke mbeheem, ndengɗukaat po Kooh raak ɗu raakaaɗi sikka, a raakuu woyaah nga ɗu, ɗu raak jam na ɗe. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Te ambaat ne : Sekɗohi Heɗi na sekɗohe, a waaɗ ne ɓooɓi muc, findi Pool, ɓaah ɓoo yi ɓoo keeñkoh namoh ɗu wa woo ŋ fiisi a kaɓɗoh ɗu, ŋ liiɓohaaɗi moɗiɗi Kooh on ɗe.<verse eid="2PE 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Ineem weɗ a na woye ŋ fiis ci a na kaɓɗohe jen, ci a na woyohe in ceem. Raakiɗ ɓak nga ca, ca yooɓɗi inhu, tahha po inhaaɗiici na ɓi mokiɗɗi baahiɗ waasi na ɓoƴsohe ɓoƴsoh ini ca tokis. Ɓa na name tum ɗaa na Fiis ci cinooci. Ineem na ɓayee ɓa ŋ ɗumbu.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nakohi na askohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Waaye ɗu, ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, ŋ woyiɗ na ɗu ŋ in ceem. Wortukaat, kinaat faɗ yurhaaɗiici ɓa nookee ɗu na ɗal ciŋ ɓa po ɗu ndengissuu ŋ kosi ɗu kos. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Baahohi Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, Mucɗohiŋ ɓoo baahoh ɗu, na inhi ɗu inah ɗe, ɓaatkaat ɓaatuk. A yi yakɗaah woti po faw ! [Amiin !]<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>